# 🚀 PROMPT: Instagram Graph API Production-Ready Integration (Phase 1)

Siz backend va SaaS arxitekturasi bo'yicha senior injenersiz. Loyihamizda (`AI-Inbox-backend`) Meta Instagram Graph API (Direct Messaging & Webhooks) bilan ishlash uchun 1-bosqichdagi barcha texnik va funksional talablarni 100% ishlab chiqishingiz shart.

⚠️ **QATIY QOIDA (CRITICAL RULE):**
- **NO MOCK DATA:** Hech qanday soxta (mock), hardcoded yoki dummy ma'lumot ishlatmang. Barcha servislar, token almashtirish va API so'rovlar real Meta Graph API (`https://graph.facebook.com/v18.0/`) bilan integratsiya qilinishi va PostgreSQL bazasi bilan ishlashi shart.
- Loyihamiz multi-tenant arxitekturada (`Store` → `Customer` → `ChatMessage`).

---

### 📌 TOPSHIRIQ TARKIBI (5 ta asosiy task):

#### 1. 🔑 Meta OAuth 2.0 & Long-Lived Access Token Management Engine
- **Short-to-Long Token Exchange (`apps/stores/services.py` & `views.py`):**
  - Frontend'dan kelgan short-lived user access tokenni Meta API (`GET /oauth/access_token?grant_type=fb_exchange_token...`) orqali **60 kunlik Long-Lived User Token**ga almashtiring.
  - Ushbu token orqali foydalanuvchining Facebook sahifalarini (`GET /me/accounts?fields=id,name,access_token,instagram_business_account`) tortib oling.
  - Unga bog'langan **Instagram Business Account ID (`ig_id`)** va **Long-Lived Page Access Token (`ig_access_token`)**ni aniqlab, `Store` modelidagi `ig_page_id`, `ig_access_token`, `ig_token_expires_at` maydonlariga saqlang.
- **Celery Periodic Token Refresh Task (`apps/stores/tasks.py`):**
  - Har kun bir marta ishlaydigan Celery Beat task yarating. Tugashiga 15 kun qolgan tokenlarni `GET /refresh_access_token` orqali avtomatik yangilab, DB'ga yozsin.
- **Frontend Connect Endpoints (`apps/stores/views.py` & `urls.py`):**
  - `POST /api/v1/stores/instagram/connect/` va `DELETE /api/v1/stores/instagram/disconnect/` endpointlarini DRF'da to'liq yozing.

#### 2. 📩 Advanced Instagram Webhook Payload Parser (`apps/webhooks/parsers.py`)
Hozirgi faqat tekstni parse qiluvchi `parse_instagram_payload` funksiyasini kengaytiring. Quyidagi barcha Meta webhook payload formatlarini qo'llab-quvvatlasin:
- **Text Messages:** Oddiy matnli xabarlar.
- **Media Attachments:** Rasm (`image`), ovozli xabar (`audio`), video (`video`), stiker (`sticker`). Media URL'larini `raw_payload` va `IncomingMessage`'ga to'liq biriktiring.
- **Story Mentions & Replies:** Mijoz do'konni o'z story'sida belgilaganda (`story_mentions`) yoki story'siga javob yozganda keluvchi payloadlarni aniqlang va tegishli tekst/media sifatida parse qiling (masalan: `"[Story Mention]: https://..."`).
- **Post & Reel Shares:** Mijoz do'konga post yoki reel havola qilganda (`attachments.type == 'share'`) uning media URL va sarlavhasini olsin.
- **Quick Replies:** Tugma bosilganda keluvchi `payload` matnini ajratib olsin.
- **Filter Echoes & Duplicates:** Bot yuborgan javoblar (`is_echo: true`) va takroriy xabarlarni rad eting.

#### 3. 👤 Instagram User Profile Fetcher Service (`apps/customers/services.py`)
Instagram webhook kelganida mijozning faqat `sender_id` (IGSID) ma'lumoti bo'ladi.
- `Customer.get_or_create_from_platform` ishlaganda, Meta Graph API'ga async/httpx so'rov yuboruvchi servis yarating:
  `GET https://graph.facebook.com/v18.0/{IGSID}?fields=name,username,profile_pic&access_token={STORE_IG_ACCESS_TOKEN}`
- Olingan `username`, `name` (full_name) va profil rasmi URL'ini `Customer` modeliga avtomatik saqlang.
- Rate-limit (429) yoki API xatolarida fallback (retry / log) qilish mantiqini kiriting.

#### 4. 📤 Outgoing Instagram Messaging & 24-Hour Policy (`apps/chat/senders.py`)
- **Media Attachment Sending:** Text xabarlardan tashqari rasm/fayl yuborish imkoniyatini qo'shing (`message: {"attachment": {"type": "image", "payload": {"url": image_url}}}`).
- **24-Hour Messaging Window Enforcement:**
  - Mijozning oxirgi xabari vaqtini (`customer.last_message_at`) tekshiring.
  - Agar 24 soat ichida bo'lsa: `messaging_type: "RESPONSE"` orqali yuboring.
  - Agar 24 soatdan o'tgan bo'lsa: Meta qoidasiga ko'ra `messaging_type: "MESSAGE_TAG"` va `tag: "HUMAN_AGENT"` parametrlari bilan yuborishni ta'minlang.
- Meta Error handling: Token eskirgan (190, 102), user block qilgan yoki rate limit holatlarini to'g'ri ushlang va log yozing.

#### 5. 📄 Public Legal & Meta Verification Views (`apps/core/views.py`)
Meta App Review va Dashboard talablariga mos ravishda Django public HTML template/json view'larini yarating:
- `GET /privacy-policy/` — Meta talabiga mos Maxfiylik Siyosati sahifasi.
- `POST /api/v1/meta/data-deletion/` — Meta User Data Deletion Callback URL (Meta foydalanuvchisi ma'lumotlarini o'chirish so'rovi yuborganda `confirmation_code` va status qaytaruvchi endpoint).

---

### 🧪 VERIFICATION & QUALITY STANDARDS:
1. Barcha kodlarda `httpx` kutubxonasi orqali timeout (15s) va exception handling bo'lishi kerak.
2. Celery tasklarda `max_retries=3`, `acks_late=True` va `backoff` ishlatilishi shart.
3. Yangi o'zgartirishlardan so'ng mavjud Telegram webhook va Celery tasklar buzilib ketmasligi kerak (Telegram va Instagram parallel parallel ishlashi lozim).

Ushbu vazifalarni bosqichma-bosqich, to'liq, clean code va barcha chekka holatlarni (edge-cases) inobatga olib amalga oshiring.






